description: Strict Swift quality bar for humanized-type and other Swift packages
alwaysApply: true
---

# Swift — no shortcuts (strict)

- NEVER use force unwrap (`!`), force cast (`as!`), `try!`, or IUOs
  (`Type!`) in production code. Prefer `guard let` / `if let` / `Result`.
- NEVER leave `TODO` / `FIXME` that SwiftLint would flag as error.
- ALWAYS keep Core (pure timing / scheduling) free of AppKit / CGEvent so
  unit tests stay hermetic.
- ALWAYS run `scripts/validate` (SwiftLint `--strict`, `swift test`,
  `swift build -c release`) before claiming done.
- When changing sampler / digraph / error behavior: update SPM tests in the
  same change.
